      "writtenOn": "2025-07-16T14:56:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this IS the definition of what is called a musicFx and isMusicEffect ios only used in the context of isNonOffloadableEffectEnabled().\nYou can change the name of isMusicEffect() if you think it is not clearly indicating its role, but adding the condition that the session is OUTPUT_MIX fits into the definition of what a music effect is.",
      "parentUuid": "01210981_d02d99cd",
