      "writtenOn": "2025-07-16T15:05:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Eric, the issue we\u0027re fixing here requires it not to be treated as a music effect (if follows your direction) so it can lift the bar and allow the offload playback on a different audio session to continue. Do you mean as long as the effect session is NOT on MIX OUTPUT it should not be treated as a music effect?",
      "parentUuid": "7b474d6c_1b10405d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 169,
