      "writtenOn": "2025-07-16T15:44:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree this would cover all aspects of the issue. I did a search and it seems for the case that a non-offloadable effect on an offload track session (on its own)  case, it has been handled in tracks.cpp:\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/services/audioflinger/Tracks.cpp;drc\u003d61197364367c9e404c7da6900658f1b16c42d0da;l\u003d1389\nif you agree, that would leave us only need to consider OUTPUT_MIX case with  isNonOffloadableEffectEnabled() right?",
